          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can we combine Kushinagar with Bodh Gaya?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Not in 2 days—too compressed for quality meditation. Recommend separate circuits or extend to 4-5 days for full Buddhist circuit (Varanasi-Sarnath-Kushinagar-Bodhgaya)."
